  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electoral reform Kenya</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Valreform Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till valreform och genomf&#xf6;rande av folkomr&#xf6;stning om en ny konstitution i augusti 2010. St&#xf6;det omfattar generell institutions- och kapacitetsutveckling av interimsvalkommissionen men &#xe4;ven mer specifict innom omr&#xe5;den som tex v&#xe4;ljarregistrering och v&#xe4;ljarutbildning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to electoral reform and the referendum of a new constitution in Kenya. The support includes general institutional- and capacity building of the Independent interim electoral commission, IIEC, but also specifically on areas as voter registration, voter educationa nd the actual conduct of the referendum of a new constitution.</narrative>
  </description>
